HB0060HW001/ADOPTED (CORRECTED COPY)
Page 3-line 2 Delete "(viii)" and insert "(ix)".
Page 4-after line 2 Insert and renumber as necessary:
"(vii) "Individual sport" means an athletic activity where
participants compete as individuals for a time, score or result, regardless of
whether their individual time, score or result contributes to an overall team
score;".
Page 4-line 4 Delete "(vii)" and insert "(viii)".
Page 4-line 7 Delete "(viii)" and insert "(ix)".
Page 7-after line 2 Insert:
"(h) In the case of an individual sport, only the students of the female
sex directly competing against a student that the school knows or, to a
reasonable degree of certainty believes, is a student of the male sex are
prohibited from competing in that athletic activity.". LAWLEY
